<title>AUSTRALIA: Foodland jumps after half-yr profit jump.</title>
<headline>Foodland jumps after half-yr profit jump.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Australian and New Zealand food retailer and wholesaler Foodland Associated Ltd jumped more than three percent after it announced a strong rise in its first half year profit.</p>
<p>At 11.25 a.m. (0125 GMT), Foodland shares were 22 cents or 3.28 percent up at A$6.92 on low volume.</p>
<p>The group said earlier that net profit rose 34.7 percent to A$28.7 million in the six months ended January 31, 1997.</p>
<p>-- Kevin Morrison 61-2 9373-1813</p>
</text>
